{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And it was told to Jacob.</b> The verse is elliptical." "<b>And Israel strengthened himself.</b> He strengthened himself with all his might to appear healthy, for the gift of a dying man — if he recovers, he can retract it. And now, since he wished to bless them, he intended that his gift be the gift of a healthy man, which cannot be retracted."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:58.241301822Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}